    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a simple 2D platform action game with rogue-lite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play in a room. You can clear the game by avoiding enemies swarming around you and surviving for 5 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297030/extras/b2af6b2fb53d01d60d0c3e4655944bd4.avif?t=1741282436\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first you may find it difficult to choose a skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297030/extras/a1ce10251342696a511be460bd11daed.avif?t=1741282436\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find it difficult to complete the game, I recommend you shut down the game and take a rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will discover something new every time you start the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I believe you will recognize the true identity of this room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a simple 2D platform action game with rogue-lite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play in a room. You can clear the game by avoiding enemies swarming around you and surviving for 5 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297030/extras/b2af6b2fb53d01d60d0c3e4655944bd4.avif?t=1741282436\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first you may find it difficult to choose a skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297030/extras/a1ce10251342696a511be460bd11daed.avif?t=1741282436\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you find it difficult to complete the game, I recommend you shut down the game and take a rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will discover something new every time you start the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I believe you will recognize the true identity of this room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
